{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>See.</b> With the eye of glory." "And the one called is Bezalel, and the meaning is \"I called him by name,\" for there is none like him to make the Tabernacle." "And according to the plain sense, Caleb son of Jephunneh is not Caleb son of Hezron, by absolute proofs — and the discerning will understand them."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:39:32.304654903Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}